,"synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15628","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120859","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42395","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"396903","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"51395","synopsis":"First years Yoigoshi and Azemichi go up against second years Misumi and Date in a practice match resulting in the first years suffering an overwhelming defeat. Realizing that the cause of their failure is their lack of coordinated teamwork, and that he'll have to work with Azemichi, makes Yoigoshi angry. Then he gets a flash of inspiration. If they need to work together to win, then they can use codes to coordinate their plays. Yoigoshi and Azemichi begin secret training sessions. All fired up, they challenge the second years once more!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t3Qtzq8P6z1XfOrIbH0cGMBYy4P.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"First years Yoigoshi and Azemichi go up against second years Misumi and Date in a practice match resulting in the first years suffering an overwhelming defeat. Realizing that the cause of their failure is their lack of coordinated teamwork, and that he'll have to work with Azemichi, makes Yoigoshi angry. Then he gets a flash of inspiration. If they need to work together to win, then they can use codes to coordinate their plays. Yoigoshi and Azemichi begin secret training sessions. All fired up, they challenge the second years once more!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t3Qtzq8P6z1XfOrIbH0cGMBYy4P.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15628","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120859","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42395","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"396903","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"51479","synopsis":"As Yoigoshi tries to find a way to capture the feeling of \"winning\" in training, his impatience begins to take over. Iura realizes this and tells him to make use of his superlative potential to become \"Noukin's Beast,\" the strongest raider. Later, while Yoigoshi is out running, he crashes into a slightly built male whose presence he hadn't sensed at all. This person is only just recovering from a stay in the hospital and his identity is...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oEAYaPsKeiis5STYZV1QBrpukzG.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"As Yoigoshi tries to find a way to capture the feeling of \"winning\" in training, his impatience begins to take over. Iura realizes this and tells him to make use of his superlative potential to become \"Noukin's Beast,\" the strongest raider. Later, while Yoigoshi is out running, he crashes into a slightly built male whose presence he hadn't sensed at all. This person is only just recovering from a stay in the hospital and his identity is...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oEAYaPsKeiis5STYZV1QBrpukzG.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15628","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120859","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42395","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"396903","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"51576","synopsis":"Ojo talks about becoming number one in Japan with the teammates he's trained so hard alongside through kabaddi. For that purpose, he wants them to experience a match, so he arranges a practice game with a school whose team includes a member who was part of the World Squad, a group of top-tier kabaddi athletes. They will be facing Ojo's old friend and rival, Rokugen Ayumu, and the ace raider, Takaya Ren, on a powerhouse team that made it to the Kanto region's final four — Souwa High School's kabaddi team.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5ZtxZXdaUeJLPiXQOQKGTBluodA.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Ojo talks about becoming number one in Japan with the teammates he's trained so hard alongside through kabaddi. For that purpose, he wants them to experience a match, so he arranges a practice game with a school whose team includes a member who was part of the World Squad, a group of top-tier kabaddi athletes. They will be facing Ojo's old friend and rival, Rokugen Ayumu, and the ace raider, Takaya Ren, on a powerhouse team that made it to the Kanto region's final four — Souwa High School's kabaddi team.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5ZtxZXdaUeJLPiXQOQKGTBluodA.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15628","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120859","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42395","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"396903","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"51658","synopsis":"Yoigoshi's successful raid has earned his team 3 points. Noukin thought they had momentum on their side, but with Takaya scoring a huge number of points and Rokugen executing perfect defense, the tables are turned and the point spread grows larger and larger. The fact that all of Takaya's attention is trained on Ojo sitting on the bench makes Yoigoshi angry. With the widening point gap, Azemichi's injury, and Noukin's weakening mental fortitude, the only one who can save them would have to be...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n7ngCf31bt9F4OnpIYrPrM1jBPv.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Yoigoshi's successful raid has earned his team 3 points. Noukin thought they had momentum on their side, but with Takaya scoring a huge number of points and Rokugen executing perfect defense, the tables are turned and the point spread grows larger and larger. The fact that all of Takaya's attention is trained on Ojo sitting on the bench makes Yoigoshi angry. With the widening point gap, Azemichi's injury, and Noukin's weakening mental fortitude, the only one who can save them would have to be...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n7ngCf31bt9F4OnpIYrPrM1jBPv.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15628","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120859","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42395","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"396903","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"51737","synopsis":"The second half of the match begins. Ojo and Takaya battle furiously, switching from offense to defense and back again. Noukin closes the point gap to four points. Then, Iura tells Ojo he can't go out on the next raid. If Ojo, tired as he is, gets injured, they won't be able to enter the upcoming tournament. It's a decision made to keep Noukin's dreams from ending. Once Ojo understands Iura's true intentions, he entrusts the task of sending Takaya out to Yoigoshi.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wlkDg6yrUYj85D6VEsBexodpTBi.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"The second half of the match begins. Ojo and Takaya battle furiously, switching from offense to defense and back again. Noukin closes the point gap to four points. Then, Iura tells Ojo he can't go out on the next raid. If Ojo, tired as he is, gets injured, they won't be able to enter the upcoming tournament. It's a decision made to keep Noukin's dreams from ending. Once Ojo understands Iura's true intentions, he entrusts the task of sending Takaya out to Yoigoshi.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wlkDg6yrUYj85D6VEsBexodpTBi.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15628","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120859","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42395","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"396903","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"51846","synopsis":"First year Ban Nobutaka brings a club application form saying he wants to join the kabaddi team. Ban is a bit of an odd one who wears his hair in a pompadour, has a mean look to his eyes, and in spite of all that, has a tiny, quiet voice. He arrives at the gym with two fellow first years, Seki Ryuta and Hitomi Yuki, who say he invited them to come along. The truth is, this man called Ban has met Yoigoshi back in second grade. It all happened one very hot day...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5lAsaIVIxKEtyNR06ETyOZCNz1Y.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"First year Ban Nobutaka brings a club application form saying he wants to join the kabaddi team. Ban is a bit of an odd one who wears his hair in a pompadour, has a mean look to his eyes, and in spite of all that, has a tiny, quiet voice. He arrives at the gym with two fellow first years, Seki Ryuta and Hitomi Yuki, who say he invited them to come along. The truth is, this man called Ban has met Yoigoshi back in second grade. It all happened one very hot day...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5lAsaIVIxKEtyNR06ETyOZCNz1Y.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15628","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"120859","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"42395","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"105721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"396903","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"51957","synopsis":"Misumi is feeling troubled. Since he's been paired with Date for so long, he doesn't know what he should do as an anti in the new formations. \"What did I used to do before this guy was around...?\" In his first tournament after joining the team, Misumi experienced failure and frustration. Not wanting to feel that miserable ever again, Misumi invites Date, who has a very athletic build, to the kabaddi team, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fBtpoAqvQ1n9LARo28aJ85ZjxHZ.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Misumi is feeling troubled. Since he's been paired with Date for so long, he doesn't know what he should do as an anti in the new formations. \"What did I used to do before this guy was around...?\" In his first tournament after joining the team, Misumi experienced failure and frustration. Not wanting to feel that miserable ever again, Misumi invites Date, who has a very athletic build, to the kabaddi team, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fBtpoAqvQ1n9LARo28aJ85ZjxHZ.jpg",